{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "friends-bingo-api-collection",
    "name": "Friends Bingo API",
    "description": "Complete API documentation for the Friends Bingo backend system. This API manages bingo games, user wallets, deposits, withdrawals, and game operations.\n\n## Base URL\n```\nhttp://localhost:3000\n```\n\n## Authentication\nMost endpoints require JWT authentication. Include the token in the Authorization header:\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>\n```\n\n## Payment Providers\n- `CBE` - Commercial Bank of Ethiopia\n- `TELEBIRR` - TeleBirr mobile money\n\n## Game Statuses\n- `NEXT` - Game is upcoming\n- `CHECKING` - Game is in checking phase\n- `PLAYING` - Game is actively playing\n- `FINISHED` - Game has ended\n- `CANCELLED` - Game was cancelled\n\n## User Roles\n- `PLAYER` - Regular player\n- `ADMIN` - Administrator with management capabilities",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
